msgid ""
"Confirm the PIN you use on this computer and choose a new master password. "
"Everything in the vault is encrypted again, and the PIN keeps working. "
"Backups made earlier still need the master password they were made with."
msgstr ""
"Bekreft datamaskinens PIN-kode og velg et nytt hovedpassord. Hele hvelvet "
"krypteres på nytt, og PIN-koden fortsetter å virke. Eldre sikkerhetskopier "
"krever fortsatt hovedpassordet fra den gang."

msgid "Confirm your master password to create a backup."
msgstr "Bekreft hovedpassordet ditt for å opprette en sikkerhetskopi."

msgid "Confirm your master password to export your data."
msgstr "Bekreft hovedpassordet ditt for å eksportere dataene dine."

